			<div class="content" id="post-content-2741279">
									

<p>I like the general Xia mythos, but this felt rather slow and repetitive. Why was the initial &quot;fake&quot; article necessary (either in-universe or as a narrative tool)? Similarly for the first few interviews where -3 obscures the truth - that all seemed to lead to re-treading a lot of the same ground, and I'm not sure the &quot;building of trust&quot; narrative justifies the verbiage.</p>

