<p>I like this SCP.</p>
<p>I'm not that familiar with Chinese mythology, but the Xia mythos skips always put on a good show, and make the concepts interesting to me. Additionally, I like the characterization of the AI, and its use of deception for what it believes to be the greater good.</p>
<p>I would argue that the &quot;False flag article, your real article is in another castle&quot; bit is starting to wear out its welcome (not quite to the level of End of Article Exposition Note, but its getting there). Still, I find the narrative and potential foreshadowing more than make up for that.</p>
<p>+1. Good job Sunny.</p>

